        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Background:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "HTT has been reported to interact with the p53. From the current literature, it is unclear if this is a direct physical interaction - PMID: 10823891. To my knowledge, no experiments have been published investigating this interaction with purified protein samples."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Preliminary experiments with PRC2 pull-down indicate that huntingtin binds non-specifically to cobalt resin so FLAG beads were used for the pull down "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "https://zenodo.org/record/803263",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://zenodo.org/record/803263"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "p53 samples were purified previously here: "
