    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Buffer: 50 mM Tris pH 8, 150 mM NaCl, 1 mM TCEP, 5% glycerol, 0.005 % Tween-20. All reactions in 200 µL total."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Samples were incubated at 4 °C for 30 mins before binding to 20 µl FLAG beads per sample at 4 °C for 30 mins. Beads were washed with 3 x 1 mL buffer. Samples eluted in 200 µL 1 x SDS loading buffer at 95 °C for 2 mins. 10 µL (5 %) of input (I), flow through (FT) wash (W) and elution (E) loaded onto 4-20 % Tris-Glycine SDS-PAGE for each sample."
        }
      ]
    },
