    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Huntingtin Q23"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[Figure not imported: ProtoELN can’t store images yet. See it in ",
