    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "p53 FL p53 DNA-BD"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I – input FT - flow through W - wash E - elution"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "HTT is present in input and elution fractions only indicating efficient binding to the FLAG."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "p53-FL appears weakly on the gel suggesting that the protein has degraded or precipitated since purification following a freeze-thaw sample. A band of the same MW as p53-FL is weakly visible in the FT but not in the W or E. However, with such low levels of protein present, this remains an inconclusive result."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "p53-DNA-BD is clearly visible in the input. Whilst a band of the same size is seen in the FT and E, this is independent of whether HTT is present so p53-DNA-BD does not appear to interact with HTT under these conditions."
        }
      ]
    }
